Hi,

I am wondering if anyone can point me to somewhere I can download the gene-centric CDF for HT-HG-U133A arrays. I have searched around, but the only CDF I can find is from affymetrix website. I would like to process some arrays to get gene-level data. I followed the script example (http://www.aroma-project.org/vignettes/GeneSTArrayAnalysis) to extract the data, but the data is still at probe level. I appreciate anyone's help.

Thanks,
BJ

