Hi Hernik,

Clearing the cache as you suggested did the trick:

> clearCache(dirs="aroma.affymetrix", recursive=TRUE, prompt=FALSE)

Calculation of the sets of pobes with common SNP nucleotide pairs took much more time after clearing the cache and I finally got 6 groups + "missing" as expected. There must have been some corrupt files in my cache.

Thanks again for your help!

Best,
Hans-Ulrich

